---
globs:
  - "src/agent/triage/**"
  - "src/prWorkspace/writablePrCheckout.ts"
  - "src/agentWork/executors/triageExecutor.ts"
---

Triage run: same-repo only (forks report-only); never force-push, rebase, or amend; push-or-nothing before resolving threads; dismissed requires maintainer reply evidence and is never auto-resolved by triage; use `git commit -n` (hooks off); keep sensitive-path / message / size validation server-side (ADR 0018). Writable PR checkout must stay isolated from the shared PR repository view cache.
